{#
/**
 * Card — image- or icon-led spark-card with a wayfinding color bar. The whole
 * card is the link (stretched); hover gives the lift + accent bar + arrow
 * slide + image zoom from .spark-card.
 */
#}
{% set c = c|default('none') %}
{% set icon = icon|default('none') %}
{% set more_label = more_label|default('Learn more') %}
{% set has_image = image.src|default('') is not empty %}
{% set io = has_image ? dx_image(image, '(min-width: 1024px) 33vw, 100vw') : { srcset: null } %}
{% set c_map = {
  'none': { bar: 'border-t-primary-600', chip: 'bg-primary-50 text-primary-700', more: 'text-primary-700' },
  'sky': { bar: 'border-t-sky-600', chip: 'bg-sky-50 text-sky-700', more: 'text-sky-700' },
  'clay': { bar: 'border-t-clay-600', chip: 'bg-clay-50 text-clay-700', more: 'text-clay-700' },
  'accent': { bar: 'border-t-accent-600', chip: 'bg-accent-50 text-accent-700', more: 'text-accent-700' },
} %}
{% set cc = c_map[c]|default(c_map['none']) %}

{#
  FEATURE VARIANT (2026-08-10, ported from BentoGrid.astro's featured item).
  The tall dark photo card that breaks a uniform card matrix. It is a CARD
  prop, not a grid prop, because in Canvas the cards are slot children and a
  section cannot restyle its own children — so the grid owns the 2x2 span
  (section_cards layout=bento) and the card owns how it looks.

  object-cover here, unlike the default variant's object-contain: this variant
  is only ever used with a chosen hero-grade photograph, never with whatever
  logo or scanned form an import happened to carry.
#}
{% if variant|default('default') == 'feature' %}
  {% set fio = has_image ? dx_image(image, '(min-width: 1024px) 50vw, 100vw') : { srcset: null, sizes: null } %}
  <article data-surface="dark" class="spark-card group/card relative flex h-full min-h-[22rem] flex-col justify-end overflow-hidden rounded-2xl bg-primary-900 text-white shadow-sm">
    {% if has_image %}
      <img
        src="{{ image.src }}" alt="{{ image.alt|default('') }}"
        class="spark-card__img absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover"
        loading="lazy" decoding="async"
        {% if fio.srcset %}srcset="{{ fio.srcset }}" sizes="{{ fio.sizes }}"{% endif %}
      >
      {# Two-part scrim, matching section_hero's fullbleed rule: one flat
         to-transparent wash over the whole photo is the muddy version. #}
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-primary-900/45" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 h-2/3 bg-gradient-to-t from-primary-900 via-primary-900/70 to-transparent" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    {% else %}
      <div class="absolute inset-0 brand-glow" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    {% endif %}
    <div class="relative p-7">
      {% if stat|default('') %}
        <p class="text-4xl font-extrabold leading-none tabular-nums text-white">{{ stat }}</p>
        {% if stat_label|default('') %}
          <p class="mt-1 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-primary-100">{{ stat_label }}</p>
        {% endif %}
      {% endif %}
      <h3 class="{{ stat|default('') ? 'mt-5' : '' }} text-2xl font-bold text-white">
        {% if url|default('') %}
          <a href="{{ url }}" class="after:absolute after:inset-0 focus:outline-none">{{ title }}</a>
        {% else %}
          {{ title }}
        {% endif %}
      </h3>
      {% if body|default('') %}
        <div class="mt-2 line-clamp-3 text-[0.95rem] leading-relaxed text-primary-100">{{ body|raw }}</div>
      {% endif %}
      {% if url|default('') %}
        <p class="spark-card__more mt-5 text-sm font-bold text-white">
          {{ more_label }}
          <span class="spark-card__arrow dx-icon dx-icon--sm" aria-hidden="true">{{- source('@drupalx_theme/dist/icons/arrow-right.svg') -}}</span>
        </p>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
  </article>

{% else %}
<article class="spark-card group/card relative flex h-full flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-primary-100 border-t-4 {{ cc.bar }} bg-white shadow-sm">
  {#
    MEDIA SLOT — kept at parity with PathwayGroup.astro / CardGroup.astro
    (2026-08-02). Three changes, all measured on the cbtrust import:

    1. aspect-[16/10], not aspect-video. Jay: "our starter cards should do a
       more landscape ratio i think and less square". 16/9 is short enough to
       crop a portrait or a tall logo badly once the image is letterboxed
       rather than cropped; 16/10 (1.6) still reads clearly landscape.
    2. object-contain, not object-cover. Issuer imagery is whatever the issuer
       happens to have — logos, scanned forms, spreadsheet screenshots — and
       cover chops all of it to the slot without knowing what matters
       (cbtrust's branding page showed logos sliced through the wordmark).
       Contain scales the whole image in and letterboxes the remainder against
       the card's own tint, so a card never shows a fragment of something.
    3. A placeholder tile for an imageless card in an IMAGE-LED grid, so the
       row keeps one rhythm. Opt-in via `placeholder` because a grid where NO
       card has an image wants the icon chip instead — a wall of identical
       placeholder tiles is decoration standing in for information. In the
       Astro starters the group derives this from its own cards; here the card
       is a Canvas slot child and cannot see its siblings, so the choice is a
       prop the section (or the importer) sets.
  #}
  {% if has_image %}
    {# image_fit=cover is OPT-IN: contain stays the default so an import can
       never show a fragment of a logo or a scanned form, while a CURATED grid
       of real photographs can fill the slot edge to edge and actually read
       image-led (2026-08-26). #}
    <div class="flex aspect-[16/10] items-center justify-center overflow-hidden bg-primary-50">
      <img
        src="{{ image.src }}" alt="{{ image.alt|default('') }}"
        class="spark-card__img h-full w-full {{ image_fit|default('contain') == 'cover' ? 'object-cover' : 'object-contain' }}"
        loading="lazy" decoding="async"
        {% if io.srcset %}srcset="{{ io.srcset }}" sizes="{{ io.sizes }}"{% endif %}
      >
    </div>
  {% elseif placeholder|default(false) %}
    <div class="relative flex aspect-[16/10] items-center justify-center overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-br from-primary-50 via-accent-50 to-sky-50">
      <div class="absolute -right-10 -top-12 size-44 rounded-full bg-accent-500/15 blur-3xl"></div>
      <div class="absolute -bottom-14 -left-10 size-44 rounded-full bg-sky-300/25 blur-3xl"></div>
      <div class="relative flex size-16 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-white/80 shadow-sm ring-1 ring-accent-600/10 backdrop-blur">
        {% include 'drupalx_theme:icon' with { name: icon != 'none' ? icon : 'file-text', size: 'md' } only %}
      </div>
    </div>
  {% endif %}
  <div class="flex flex-1 flex-col p-6">
    {% if not has_image and not placeholder|default(false) and icon != 'none' %}
      {# data-icon-led: the chip IS the card's visual lead. verify-design-rules
         accepts it in place of a photo; without the marker every icon grid on
         the site reads as an image-less content grid (ogemaw, 2026-08-26). #}
      <span data-icon-led class="mb-4 inline-flex w-12 h-12 items-center justify-center rounded-xl {{ cc.chip }}">
        {% include 'drupalx_theme:icon' with { name: icon, size: 'md' } only %}
      </span>
    {% endif %}
    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-primary-800">
      {% if url|default('') %}
        <a href="{{ url }}" class="after:absolute after:inset-0 focus:outline-none">{{ title }}</a>
      {% else %}
        {{ title }}
      {% endif %}
    </h3>
    {#
      Clamped to 4 lines. An unbounded summary ran past the card's bottom edge
      and was cut MID-SENTENCE with no ellipsis on the cbtrust import. The
      shaper is told to keep card bodies short, but a component that depends on
      a model behaving is not a component that holds.
    #}
    {% if body|default('') %}
      <div class="mt-2 line-clamp-4 text-[0.95rem] leading-relaxed text-ink-500">{{ body|raw }}</div>
    {% endif %}
    {% if url|default('') %}
      <p class="spark-card__more mt-auto pt-4 text-sm font-bold {{ cc.more }}">
        {{ more_label }}
        <span class="spark-card__arrow dx-icon dx-icon--sm" aria-hidden="true">{{- source('@drupalx_theme/dist/icons/arrow-right.svg') -}}</span>
      </p>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
</article>
{% endif %}
